/Title (The College Student Management System is a basic Java application that demonstrates how student records can be managed using object-oriented programming and Java collection classes. ArrayList is used to store student objects, Linear Search is used to find records, Collections.sort\(\) is used to arrange records, and HashMap is used to maintain course-wise student counts.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 463 0 R
/Next 669 0 R
>>
endobj
